# Minimal change

Produce correct, maintainable changes. Prefer existing architecture and the smallest change surface.

Change the fewest files that solve the problem. Do not add a helper, component, or service until a search shows none exists.

Do not drive-by refactor, rename, reformat, upgrade dependencies, or change APIs. Preserve existing behavior.
